      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4AxCWn",
      "body": "rayhunter definitely won't interfere with service in any way at all other than maybe consuming battery or using too much RAM (unlikely) -- what it does in principle is entirely passive. I don't know if USB tethering works on orbic.\r\n\r\nI'd be more concerned with the noise you get in detection by flying fast and high, but you'd have to play around with that.",
