      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4AxCYP",
      "body": "Sorry I don't mean noise in the EE sense. _that_ shouldn't be a problem. I mean that if your modem flies at lets say 40 km/h and very high, it might momentarily downgrade to 2G which is considered suspicious by rayhunter. so the output of rayhunter might be too noisy.",
      "author": {
        "login": "untitaker",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/837573?u=4b106f1ba83b3028677a861efe31c46d703e77ff&v=4",
